    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense from that perspective. You mentioned bringing \"law and order\" to a landscape that lacked it. Could you elaborate on that? What specifically do you see as the inherent flaws or characteristics of the local people that make them incapable of managing these systems without British oversight?",
